      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{由随机变量和的方差与协方差的关系、相关系数的定义知，}\\quad\\\\D(\\xi-\\eta)=D(\\xi)+D(\\eta)-2\\mathrm{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)=D(\\xi)+D(\\eta)-2\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)\\cdot\\sqrt{D(\\xi)D(\\eta)}=13\\;.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{由随机变量和的方差与协方差的关系、相关系数的定义知，}\\quad\\\\D(\\xi-\\eta)=D(\\xi)+D(\\eta)-2\\mathrm{cov}(\\xi,\\eta)=D(\\xi)+D(\\eta)-2\\rho(\\xi,\\eta)\\cdot\\sqrt{D(\\xi)D(\\eta)}=13\\;.\\end{aligned}</div>"
