 x^{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{8}(x+y)dy dx = \\frac{1}{4} \\int_{0}^{2} (x^{3}+x^{2})dx = \\frac{5}{3}.\\\\ \\text{由对称性知，} &amp;\\quad E(Y^{2}) = \\frac{5}{3}, \\text{ 故} \\\\ &amp;\\quad D(X) = E(X^{2}) - [E(X)]^{2} = \\frac{5}{3} - \\left( \\frac{7}{6} \\right)^{2} = \\frac{11}{36}, D(Y) = \\frac{11}{36}, \\\\ &amp;\\quad \\rho_{XY} = \\frac{\\operatorname{cov}(X,Y)}{\\sqrt{D(X)D(Y)}} = \\frac{-\\frac{1}{36}}{\\frac{11}{36}} = -\\frac{1}{11}, \\\\ &amp;\\quad D(X+Y) = D(X) + D(Y) + 2 \\operatorname{cov}(X,Y) = \\frac{11}{36} + \\frac{11}{36} - 2 \\times \\frac{1}{36} = \\frac{5}{9}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
